# entry is for the copy left here by older builds, which is a SAVE FILE -
# somebody's campaign, not source.
iron_line_profile.json

# ---- build output -------------------------------------------------------
build/
dist/
*.manifest

# ---- python -------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
chk.pyc

# ---- development screenshots --------------------------------------------
# EVERY .png in this repository is a render made while working on
# something - a body sheet, a map, a UI frame - and none of them are used
# by the game, which draws all of its own graphics in code.
#
# If a real image asset is ever added, give it an exception here:
#     !assets/whatever.png
*.png

# ---- audio --------------------------------------------------------------
# Same story. All eighteen pieces are generated in code; vermilion_theme.ogg
# is the recording THE VENGEANCE replaced and nothing loads it any more.
*.ogg
*.wav
*.mp3

# ---- editor / tooling ---------------------------------------------------
